{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YAR is a fully-fledged open-world RPG, granting you the freedom to go wherever you please and do whatever you like. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Complete captivating <u>quests</u> crafted with heart and soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Will you become a valiant <u>Warrior</u> or a wise <u>Mage</u>? Your faction choice will shape your story\u2019s development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Discover <u>secrets</u> and ancient <u>artifacts</u> as you explore vast lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Visit eerie <u>dungeons</u> in search of treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Traverse forests, fields, lakes, swamps, icy mountains, scorched woods, lava lands, and numerous dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Encounter legendary characters from Eastern European folklore and mythology. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Create weapons and armor, practice Alchemy, Cooking, Blacksmithing, Magic Crafting, and many other professions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Learn new skills and abilities with a unique and engaging combat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Utilize melee weapons, bows, crossbows, scrolls, spells, and enchantments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Level up your character and enhance their attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pray to the Gods for blessings and gifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Master the art of fishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play the card game &quot;Koshun,&quot; participate in fistfights, and compete in archery contests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a magical world and the spirit of the Boreyians! Help the Elders and free the land from evil!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2669860?t=1762518419","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2669860?t=1762518419","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669860/af8d6366350898d57cef741a80f049d631a7e0a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762518419","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669860/af8d6366350898d57cef741a80f049d631a7e0a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762518419","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >YAR is a fully-fledged open-world RPG, granting you the freedom to go wherever you please and do whatever you like. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Complete captivating <u>quests</u> crafted with heart and soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Will you become a valiant <u>Warrior</u> or a wise <u>Mage</u>? Your faction choice will shape your story\u2019s development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Discover <u>secrets</u> and ancient <u>artifacts</u> as you explore vast lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Visit eerie <u>dungeons</u> in search of treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Traverse forests, fields, lakes, swamps, icy mountains, scorched woods, lava lands, and numerous dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Encounter legendary characters from Eastern European folklore and mythology. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Create weapons and armor, practice Alchemy, Cooking, Blacksmithing, Magic Crafting, and many other professions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Learn new skills and abilities with a unique and engaging combat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Utilize melee weapons, bows, crossbows, scrolls, spells, and enchantments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Level up your character and enhance their attributes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pray to the Gods for blessings and gifts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Master the art of fishing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Play the card game &quot;Koshun,&quot; participate in fistfights, and compete in archery contests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a magical world and the spirit of the Boreyians! Help the Elders and free the land from evil!</p>","developers":["Honor Games"],"dlc":[3105070],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2669860/2de87a7e65cc01a54f0fa9661b3a143bee9ccd44/header.jpg?t=1762518419","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2669860/152513616/2090b573c1523d44c67dd296d2cde4940bbdf39a/1751296287/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751563011","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2669860/152513616/2090b573c1523d44c67dd296d2cde4940bbdf39a/1751296287/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751563011","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2669860/152513616/2090b573c1523d44c67dd296d2cde4940bbdf39a/1751296287/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751563011","id":257163463,"name":"Early access Gam